# domains/organizations — Organizations domain core

Owners: Platform team, Tenancy squad (tenancy: @nexora/platform)

Scope: the Organizations bounded context (DOMAIN_MODEL.md §1 Tenancy) —
Organization aggregate (lifecycle, profile, settings), OrganizationMembership
aggregate, value objects, domain events, repository interfaces, domain
services, and policies.

Rules:
- NO persistence, NO APIs, NO HTTP, NO infrastructure. This package is the
  pure business domain (ROADMAP.md Phase 1).
- Dependencies are limited to: @nexora/contracts, @nexora/shared. Do not add
  others.
- Repository interfaces are PORTS — the domain defines the contracts, the
  infrastructure layer supplies implementations. Never persist here.
- Reuse the canonical contracts and shared utilities; never duplicate them.
- Organization events ride the shared envelope with category `platform`
  (Tenancy is a Generic/platform domain, DOMAIN_MODEL.md DOM-01). Do not
  introduce a new event category without a compatibility review.
- Contract changes require a compatibility review.
